Rayhaan Italia Pour Homme EDP Perfume 100 ML: A Warm Aromatic Fragrance with a Sweet Tobacco Finish
Rayhaan Italia Pour Homme EDP Perfume by Rayhaan 100 ML opens with lavender, bergamot, and lemon, creating a fresh and aromatic first impression. Bergamot and lemon provide a bright citrus character, while lavender adds a clean herbal quality. Together, they create a balanced opening that feels fresh without being overly sharp.
The heart develops with honey, cinnamon, Cashmeran, and jasmine sambac. Honey introduces a smooth sweetness, while cinnamon adds gentle warmth and spice. Cashmeran contributes a soft woody texture, and jasmine sambac brings a subtle floral facet. These elements create a richer middle as the initial citrus freshness gradually fades.
As Rayhaan Italia Pour Homme settles, tobacco leaf, vanilla, and tonka bean shape the base. Tobacco leaf gives the dry-down a deeper aromatic character, while vanilla adds creamy sweetness. Tonka bean brings warmth and a slightly smooth, sweet quality that rounds out the composition.
The fragrance combines citrus, aromatic, floral, spicy, sweet, woody, tobacco, and warm facets. Its progression moves from a fresh lavender-citrus opening into a honey and cinnamon heart before settling into a warm tobacco, vanilla, and tonka base.
For regular wear, Rayhaan Italia Pour Homme can suit evening outings, dinners, dates, social gatherings, celebrations, and cooler-weather occasions. The fresh opening keeps the fragrance approachable, while the sweeter tobacco-vanilla base gives it more depth as it develops.
